    {
      "heading": "Getting Details for All Microtenants",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To get details for all Microtenants:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Send a GET request to the following endpoint in the Microtenant controller: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/{customerId}/microtenants.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Provide the customerId, the ZPA tenant ID of the customer, in the endpoint. For example: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/72057594037927936/microtenants.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "View an example response",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "{ \"totalPages\": \"3\", \"list\": [ { \"id\": \"72057594038621068\", \"creationTime\": \"1663791107\", \"modifiedBy\": \"72057594038052745\", \"name\": \"Example Microtenant\", \"enabled\": false, \"operator\": \"OR\", \"criteriaAttribute\": \"AuthDomain\", \"criteriaAttributeValues\": [ \"1467901757270.com\" ] }, { \"name\": \"Default\", \"description\": \"This is the default Microtenant for users not associated to any Microtenant\", \"enabled\": true, \"operator\": \"OR\" } ] }",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "A successful response returns code 200. To learn more, see API Response Codes and Error Messages."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Getting All Microtenants by Given Filters",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "To get all Microtenants by the given filters:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Send a POST request to the following endpoint in the Microtenant controller: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/{customerId}/microtenants/search.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Provide the customerId, the tenant ID of the ZPA customer, in the request endpoint. For example: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/72057594037987390/microtenants/search.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Use the following JSON payload to get all Microtenants by given filters.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "You choose the filter criteria to include in the JSON payload. Refer to the Adding Field Descriptions section for supported values."
