      "item": "\"enabled\": false,",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"operator\": \"OR\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"criteriaAttribute\": \"AuthDomain\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"criteriaAttributeValues\": [",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"1467901757270.com\"",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "]",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "}",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "A successful response returns code 200. To learn more, see API Response Codes and Error Messages."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Getting Name and ID for All Microtenants",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To get the name and ID for all Microtenants:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Send a GET request to the following endpoint in the Microtenant controller: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/{customerId}/microtenants/summary.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Provide the customerId, the ZPA tenant ID of the customer, in the request endpoint. For example: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/72057594037927936/microtenants/summary.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "View an example response",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "[",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "{",
      "depth": 0
    },
