      "item": "{",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"name\": \"default\"",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "}",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "]",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "A successful response returns code 200. To learn more, see About Error Codes."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Getting Details of User Session and User Microtenant ID",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To get details of a user session and a user Microtenant ID, send a GET request to the following endpoint in the Microtenant controller: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/me."
    },
    {
      "item": "View an example response",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "{",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"customerId\": \"72057594037927936\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"customerName\": \"zscaler\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"microtenantName\": \"default\"",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "}",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "A successful response returns code 200. To learn more, see API Response Codes and Error Messages."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Creating a Microtenant",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "The ability to create a Microtenant is only supported for Default Microtenant admins."
    },
    {
      "text": "To create a Microtenant:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Send a POST request to the following endpoint in the Microtenant controller: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/{customerId}/microtenants.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Provide the customerId, the ZPA tenant ID of the customer, in the request endpoint. For example: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/72057594037927936/microtenants.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Use the following JSON payload to update a Microtenant and provide the following information about the Microtenant:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "name: The name of the Microtenant.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "criteriaAttribute: The criteria attribute for the Microtenant(i.e., AuthDomain).",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "criteriaAttributeValues: The value for the criteria attribute (i.e., valid authentication domains configured for a customer).",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "You choose the Microtenant criteria in the JSON payload. Refer to the Adding Field Descriptions section for supported values."
    },
    {
      "item": "View the JSON payload",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "{",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"creationTime\": 0,",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"criteriaAttribute\": \"string\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"criteriaAttributeValues\": [",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"string\"",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "],",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"description\": \"string\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"enabled\": true,",
      "depth": 0
