    {
      "heading": "Updating a Microtenant",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "The ability to update a Microtenant is only supported for Default Microtenant admins."
    },
    {
      "text": "To update a Microtenant:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Send a PUT request to the following endpoint in the Microtenant controller: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/{customerId}/microtenants/{microtenantId}.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Provide the following in the request endpoint:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "customerId: The ZPA tenant ID of the customer.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "microtenantId: The Microtenant ID for the particular Microtenant you want to update.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "For example: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/72057594037927936/microtenants/72057594038621068."
    },
    {
      "item": "Use the following JSON payload to update a Microtenant and provide the following information about the Microtenant:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "Name: The name of the Microtenant.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "criteriaAttribute: The criteria attribute for the Microtenant(i.e., AuthDomain).",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "criteriaAttributeValues: The value for the criteria attribute (i.e., valid authentication domains configured for a customer).",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "View the JSON payload",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "{",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"creationTime\": 0,",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"criteriaAttribute\": \"string\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"criteriaAttributeValues\": [",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"string\"",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "],",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"description\": \"string\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"enabled\": true,",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"id\": \"string\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"modifiedBy\": \"string\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"modifiedTime\": 0,",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"name\": \"string\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"priority\": 0",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "}",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "View a sample JSON payload",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "{",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"name\":\"Test Microtenant\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"enabled\":false,",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"description\":\"Example Microtenant\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"criteriaAttribute\":\"AuthDomain\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"criteriaAttributeValues\":[",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"dummytest.com\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"dummytest.co.in\"",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "]",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "}",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "A successful response yields code 204, meaning the Microtenant is updated. To learn more, see API Response Codes and Error Messages."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Deleting a Microtenant",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To delete a Microtenant:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Send a DELETE request to the following endpoint in the Microtenant controller: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/{customerId}/microtenants/{microtenantId}.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Provide the following in the request endpoint:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "customerId: The ZPA tenant ID of the customer.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "microtenantId: The Microtenant ID for the particular Microtenant you want to delete.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "For example: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/72057594037927936/microtenants/72057594038621068."
    },
    {
      "text": "A successful response yields code 204, meaning the Microtenant is deleted. To learn more, see API Response Codes and Error Messages."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Getting the Details of Your Current Session",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To get the details of your current session, send a GET request to the following endpoint in the Microtenant controller: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/me."
    },
    {
      "item": "View an example response",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "{ \"customerId\": \"72057594037927936\", \"customerName\": \"Zscaler - Example User - safemarch.com\", \"microtenantId\": \"72057594038621068” \"microtenantName\": \"Example Microtenant\" }",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "A successful response returns code 200. To learn more, see API Response Codes and Error Messages."
    }
  ]
}
